      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-06",
        "episodeNumber": 1,
        "name": "Hello, Daisy",
        "overview": "Pechka is an unassuming magical girl whose magic lets her make delicious food, which she uses to prepare a lunch for the boy she has a crush on. Her modest everyday life changes completely when she is forcibly abducted into an ominous game world. Sixteen magical girls have been gathered there alongside Pechka. In this artificial virtual space, the curtain quietly rises on a nightmare that is as beautiful as it is cruel.",
        "stillPath": "/9EcdUttHh3NgM6SyLioUkFLzqe8.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-13",
        "episodeNumber": 2,
        "name": "The Players",
        "overview": "Sixteen magical girls have been assembled in a vast virtual world. The electronic fairy Fal announces a team competition with a 10-billion-yen grand prize, where players must collect “Candy.” With Pechka panicking over her complete lack of combat ability, Clantail takes the lead in redistributing the Candy. But could this become the seed of quiet mistrust among the group?",
        "stillPath": "/3B63XoQX5erx8vX8q6v4Pp83cYf.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-20",
        "episodeNumber": 3,
        "name": "Delicious Food Makes Everyone Happy",
        "overview": "Pechka and Nako begin exploring the grasslands, making their way past traps and opening a treasure chest filled with a huge amount of Candy. Their relief is short-lived when a mysterious forced-transport system activates, dragging every player into the plaza! Meanwhile, Akane continues her unsettling solo movements. In an instant, the game begins to tilt toward catastrophe.",
        "stillPath": "/8zThHTUg1ntwjKQQ4Yle2wRYjn7.jpg",
        "voteAverage": 0
      },
      {
        "airDate": "2026-10-27",
        "episodeNumber": 4,
        "name": "The Detective and the Murder",
